        <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-compass section-icon"></i> Unit Overview</h2>
        <p>The core of this unit is based on Computational Thinking as a problem-solving toolkit. It focuses on the transition from a "wicked," messy real-world problem to a formalised computational model using abstraction (simplification) and decomposition (breaking down).</p>
    </section>

