                <li>
                    <strong>B1.1.1</strong> — Problem specification construction (stakeholders, constraints, inputs/outputs, and success criteria).
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>B1.1.2/3</strong> — The four pillars: Abstraction, Algorithmic Design, Decomposition, and Pattern Recognition. Application to software development, data analysis, and machine learning.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>B1.1.4</strong> — Flowchart design and tracing using standard symbols.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
